---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="Manifesto — Going Native" description="The Going Native manifesto. Sign it with your Atproto account." />
		<style>
			main {
				max-width: 720px;
			}
			.lede {
				color: rgb(var(--gray));
				max-width: 34em;
			}
			blockquote {
				margin: 1.5em 0;
			}
			blockquote p {
				margin: 0 0 0.75em;
			}
			ul.values {
				list-style: none;
				padding: 0;
				margin: 1em 0;
			}
			ul.values li {
				margin: 0.35em 0;
				padding-left: 1.5em;
				position: relative;
			}
			ul.values li::before {
				content: '·';
				position: absolute;
				left: 0.35em;
				color: var(--accent);
			}
			ul.values li strong {
				color: rgb(var(--black));
			}
			.closing {
				margin-top: 1.25em;
			}
			hr {
				margin: 2.5em 0;
			}
			.widget {
				margin-bottom: 1em;
			}
			.widget form {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 0.5em;
				align-items: center;
				margin: 1em 0;
			}
			.widget input[type='text'] {
				flex: 1 1 16em;
				padding: 0.55em 0.75em;
				border-radius: 6px;
				border: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
				background: #121215;
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
				font-size: 1em;
			}
			.widget label {
				display: block;
				margin-bottom: 0.25em;
				color: rgb(var(--gray));
				font-size: 0.9em;
			}
			.widget .button {
				display: inline-block;
				background: var(--accent);
				color: #fff;
				border: none;
				padding: 0.6em 1.4em;
				border-radius: 6px;
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 1em;
				cursor: pointer;
			}
			.widget .button:hover {
				background: var(--accent-dark);
			}
			.widget .button:disabled {
				opacity: 0.6;
				cursor: default;
			}
			.muted {
				color: rgb(var(--gray));
			}
			.error {
				color: #ff6b6b;
			}
			.success {
				color: #4ad9a6;
			}
			.signer-list {
				list-style: none;
				padding: 0;
				margin: 0.5em 0;
			}
			.signer {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				align-items: baseline;
				gap: 1em;
				padding: 0.6em 0;
				border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
			}
			.signer:last-child {
				border-bottom: none;
			}
			.signer.withdrawn {
				opacity: 0.45;
			}
			.signer-main {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
			}
			.signer-name {
				font-weight: 700;
				color: rgb(var(--black));
			}
			.signer-handle a {
				color: rgb(var(--gray));
				text-decoration: none;
			}
			.signer-handle a:hover {
				color: var(--accent);
			}
			.signer-meta {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.5em;
				flex-shrink: 0;
			}
			.signer-date {
				color: rgb(var(--gray));
				font-size: 0.85em;
			}
			.badge {
				font-size: 0.7em;
				padding: 0.15em 0.5em;
				border-radius: 999px;
				white-space: nowrap;
			}
			.badge.verified {
				background: rgba(74, 217, 166, 0.15);
				color: #4ad9a6;
			}
			.badge.unverified {
				background: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.15);
				color: #ff6b6b;
			}
			.badge.withdrawn {
				background: rgba(140, 143, 150, 0.2);
				color: rgb(var(--gray));
			}
			.note {
				margin-top: 1.5em;
				font-size: 0.9em;
				color: rgb(var(--gray));
			}
			.note code {
				font-size: 0.85em;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Manifesto for Going Native</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				As software developers we are raising the bar of what desktop software should be
				by building it and helping others learn to build it. Through this work we have
				come to value:
			</p>

			<blockquote>
				<ul class="values">
					<li>Not only working software, but also <strong>software that respects the machine it runs on</strong></li>
					<li>Not only shipping on schedule, but also <strong>not cutting corners</strong></li>
					<li>Not only what's convenient to build, but also <strong>what doesn't ship a browser</strong></li>
					<li>Not only what users ask for, but also <strong>what respects them</strong></li>
				</ul>
				<p class="closing">
					That is, while there is value in the items on the left, we value the items on
					the right more.
				</p>
			</blockquote>

			<hr />

			<section>
				<h2>Sign the manifesto</h2>
				<div class="widget" id="sign-widget">
					<p class="muted">Loading…</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Signatures</h2>
				<div id="signer-list">
					<p class="muted">Loading…</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<p class="note">
				Signing is powered by <a href="https://atproto.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AT Protocol</a>.
				Your signature is a record in your own repo — <code>at://your-did/dev.going-native.manifesto/manifesto</code> —
				so you own it and can remove it any time with any Atproto client. The signing date is
				stamped and digitally signed by this site's backend, so nobody can claim they signed
				sooner than they did.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />

		<script>
			import '../scripts/manifesto';
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
